      ],
      "source": "https://centralmontana.com/communities/highwood/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Highwood’s post office opened in 1881, closed briefly, and has operated continuously since 1886.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Highwood%2C_Montana"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Highwood uniquely contains an old town built by McGowan and a newer town platted by the railroad.",
